---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Website privacy | Mnemee" description="How Mnemee uses analytics on its website." path="/privacy">
	<main class="privacy">
		<a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="Mnemee home"><img src="/mnemee-logo.svg" alt="Mnemee" width="125" height="32" /></a>
		<article>
			<p class="eyebrow">Mnemee</p>
			<h1>Website privacy</h1>
			<p>Essential cookies and storage support the operation of Mnemee, including account sign-in on the app. They are required to provide the service.</p>
			<p>With your permission, we use PostHog to understand how people find and visit the Mnemee website. This helps us improve it.</p>
			<h2>Analytics</h2>
			<p>If you accept analytics, PostHog collects page views and associated information such as the page URL, referrer, device and browser information. It uses browser storage and cookies to recognize visits. We do not enable session recordings or automatic interaction capture on this website.</p>
			<p>Analytics is off until you accept. You can change your choice using Cookie preferences in the homepage footer. Your preference is stored in your browser. Rejecting analytics stops future collection on this website.</p>
			<p>PostHog processes analytics information on our behalf. See <a href="https://posthog.com/privacy">PostHog's privacy notice</a> for more information.</p>
			<h2>Contact</h2>
			<p>For privacy questions, contact <a href="mailto:hello@mnemee.space">hello@mnemee.space</a>.</p>
		</article>
	</main>
</Layout>

<style>
	.privacy { min-height: 100svh; padding: 32px clamp(24px, 6vw, 80px) 96px; background: var(--surface); }
	.brand { display: inline-block; }
	.brand img { display: block; height: auto; }
	:global(html[data-theme='dark']) .brand img { filter: invert(1); }
	article { width: min(100%, 680px); margin: clamp(80px, 12vw, 144px) auto 0; }
	.eyebrow { margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--ink-muted); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; }
	h1 { margin-bottom: 28px; font-size: clamp(36px, 6vw, 56px); line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -.035em; }
	h2 { margin: 40px 0 12px; font-size: 19px; }
	article p:not(.eyebrow) { color: var(--ink-muted); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; }
	article a { color: var(--ink); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
</style>
